---
import { ArrowRight } from '@lucide/astro';
import { withBase } from '../../lib/url';
---

<section class="wrap section">
  <p class="eyebrow">Self-hosting</p>
  <h2 class="h2">Run it on your own infrastructure</h2>
  <p class="section-lede">Three services and PostgreSQL, each service with its own Dockerfile. Clerk handles sign-in.</p>
  <div class="grid">
    <div
      class="arch"
      role="img"
      aria-label="Architecture: the browser talks to frontend-beta, which calls the API; the API uses the MMR API and PostgreSQL; Clerk handles sign-in"
    >
      <div class="node"><b>Browser or installed app</b><span>Phone-first, works as a PWA</span></div>
      <div class="link">HTTPS</div>
      <div class="row2">
        <div class="node beta"><b>frontend-beta <span class="pill">Beta</span></b><span>React 19 · TanStack Start · Node</span></div>
        <div class="node"><b>Clerk</b><span>sign-in</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="link">API_BASE_PATH</div>
      <div class="node"><b>api</b><span>ASP.NET Core · v3 API · matchmaking worker</span></div>
      <div class="link"></div>
      <div class="pair">
        <div class="node"><b>mmr-api</b><span>Go · OpenSkill</span></div>
        <div class="node"><b>PostgreSQL</b><span>EF Core migrations</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="term">
        <div class="term-head"><span>Local development</span><span>bash</span></div>
        <pre><span class="p">$ </span>git clone https://github.com/office-rivals/mmr-project
<span class="p">$ </span>cd mmr-project
<span class="p">$ </span>dotnet run --project local-dev/MMRProject.AppHost
<span class="c"># in a second terminal</span>
<span class="p">$ </span>cd frontend-beta && cp .env.example .env
<span class="p">$ </span>npm ci && npm run dev</pre>
      </div>
      <p class="note">
        The Aspire AppHost starts PostgreSQL and both APIs. The beta runs beside it, pointed at the API through
        <code>API_BASE_PATH</code>.
      </p>
      <a class="arrow-link" href={withBase('/quick-start/')}>Read the quick start <ArrowRight size={16} /></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 40px;
    margin-top: 36px;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
  }
  @media (min-width: 960px) {
    .grid {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
      align-items: start;
    }
  }
  .arch {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  .node {
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 12px 14px;
    background: var(--card);
  }
  .node b {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font: 600 15px/20px var(--font-sans);
  }
  .node > span {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
  }
  .node.beta {
    border-color: var(--primary);
  }
  .node .pill {
    font-size: 11px;
    padding: 1px 8px;
  }
  .link {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    height: 30px;
    padding-left: 22px;
    font: 12px/16px var(--font-mono);
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
  }
  .link::before {
    content: '';
    width: 1px;
    height: 100%;
    background: var(--muted-foreground);
    opacity: 0.6;
  }
  .row2 {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .pair {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .term {
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .term-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 8px 12px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
  }
  pre {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 14px 14px 16px;
    overflow-x: auto;
    font: 13px/22px var(--font-mono);
  }
  .p,
  .c {
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
  }
  .p {
    user-select: none;
  }
  .note {
    margin: 12px 0 0;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
  }
</style>
